    https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/en/researchers/data-policy/
  which states that its rules are compatible with Creative Commons Attribution
  4.0 International, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  This file is redistributed under the ISAS Data Policy. It is provided "as
