5. Star catalogue data — basic/star_catalog.dat
================================================================================

Astrometry
  The built-in catalogue carries Bright Star Catalogue / Harvard (HR) numbers
  1..9110 with J2000 positions, proper motions and magnitudes. Its astrometric
  content derives from the Yale Bright Star Catalogue (Hoffleit & Warren),
  distributed by CDS as V/50,
    https://cdsarc.cds.unistra.fr/viz-bin/cat/V/50
  Catalogue data from CDS is distributed free of charge subject to the CDS
  general terms of use and to citation of the source.

